        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Petersburg%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Petersburg sits on the River Raisin, a tributary of Lake Erie, which borders its northwest edge.",
